{"text":"The third thing that I believe we agree on, I have to confess, it's actually not my point. I stole this from a Minister Sondheim, who's the Minister of International Development in Norway. When my book came out earlier in the year, I was invited to Norway, and I'd never been to Oslo. I was quite surprised because many of you will be aware, I'm sure, that Norway gives about 1% of its income to aid, so I was quite surprised. Why is this minister inviting me to visit? But I'd never been to Oslo, and I thought, you know what, what the heck? It's a nice trip to go and see what it's like there. And I had a fantastic time there, and I'm sure people who have spent a lot of time with people from Scandinavia will know that they're very, very open, they love to have debates, and it was absolutely wonderful. We had a number of public debates with a number of journalists, and one of the debates, Minister Sondheim said, and I'm paraphrasing, but he said in public...","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.7},{"text":"third","start":0.7,"end":0.96},{"text":"thing","start":0.96,"end":1.24},{"text":"that","start":1.24,"end":1.36},{"text":"I","start":1.36,"end":1.48},{"text":"believe","start":1.48,"end":1.66},{"text":"we","start":1.66,"end":1.84},{"text":"agree","start":1.84,"end":2.1},{"text":"on","start":2.1,"end":2.3,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":2.34,"end":2.44},{"text":"have","start":2.44,"end":2.62},{"text":"to","start":2.62,"end":2.78},{"text":"confess","start":2.78,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"it's","start":3.16,"end":3.22},{"text":"actually","start":3.22,"end":3.54},{"text":"not","start":3.54,"end":3.78},{"text":"my","start":3.78,"end":4.0},{"text":"point","start":4.0,"end":4.26,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":4.38,"end":4.42},{"text":"stole","start":4.42,"end":4.68},{"text":"this","start":4.68,"end":5.0},{"text":"from","start":5.0,"end":5.28},{"text":"a","start":5.28,"end":5.42},{"text":"Minister","start":5.42,"end":5.72},{"text":"Sondheim","start":5.72